{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_010_03_d",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:27d6fd712d6da0a21ebc85c7da7cbfc60c70dcc860e81c985e52506717999639",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_d:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ec7bfb44139d42124327128eeb01f9f3e1c3bcfbb9b5eb45b36ae0e0c0ea4a81",
      "text": "里面拍的是神谷先生吧。\n您喜欢旅行吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_d:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:962d7897c9ef66ada467a1eaff56886723d622df9049090e276bfcdcaa3b93d4",
      "text": "是的。在开店之前，我曾周游过\n很多国家。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_d:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:af3c51b7fb65fcc113616c42ecf185cdbd26688af13775676c9def5c16dbb6c2",
      "text": "在那段旅程中的相遇，\n促成了我开这家店的契机呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_d:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:14bbf4a7f39455285f12e39bfa02f27bce1f2e42b63796237bf032c1353417b1",
      "text": "哇～！是怎样的旅行呢？\n可以的话能跟我讲讲吗！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_d:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:54c155feebc546862a2853aff2451dc187756867c9c4d34801cdcc4a3850b2e4",
      "text": "我也想听。我也想听神谷先生旅行时的\n故事。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_d:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:64f8927df8ac5d0666e5bafa32c0bbd0dadac7500e1150dd8d963c287e554e6e",
      "text": "这个嘛……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_d:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7be0d9857a06335f7cde27ffbda7e4df83a8f42a2660dd492b896478f7edce53",
      "text": "在某国旅行的时候，我曾经遇到强盗，\n变得身无分文。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_d:cmd-000089:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cec1493fe621c3f34bc3d4940c57ec67d384091b33f10a4ebbe44113d17ee7bc",
      "text": "虽说保住了性命，但身处人迹罕至的荒野深处\n动弹不得，备受饥饿与干渴的折磨……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_d:cmd-000092:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1985ce8fe5ba939e9177d8a2471940d0a2a9f47d63dcd492dd43d0d089a82354",
      "text": "就在迎来了堪称人生最大危机的时候，\n有一位男性出现了，对倒在地上的我说道。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_d:cmd-000094:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8a68e0022ad9869a1cf89eee47deea8a764314cbfdc973f84ed85690ecfb79e8",
      "text": "“Hey boy！\n来本大爷的小餐馆吃一顿吧。包你能上天堂！”",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_d:cmd-000107:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0c23d9a81e4129f13c4e2d3cba6851c94e74f2a8e9f4f9dd8e9669c77953f914",
      "text": "那位男性的餐馆，\n简直就像个小小的马戏团。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_d:cmd-000112:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9b713d7f039eebd9da9e01f3f4f283731116def5b73174a03c3ade2b22efa210",
      "text": "色彩斑斓的三明治和饼干，\n外观自不必说，味道也十分华美、令人愉快……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_010caf_03_1_1_010_03:1_1_010_03_d:cmd-000117:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:07847ec6ccd648c3f2242e40d3408f476044efd893fdb50a1dff4d25bf7f0840",
      "text": "那份宛如Parade（游行）般的款待让我深深感动。\n特别是餐后的红茶，堪称极品呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
